OL,3,CProgramme listings for SAT 24 JAN
OL,4,G1800FOpera on 3
OL,5,     GLive from the Met, Gershwin's
OL,6,     Gfusion of opera, jazz and
OL,7,     GBroadway, Porgy and Bess,
OL,8,     Gstarring Alfred Walker and
OL,9,     GBrittany Renee.
OL,10,G2145FMusic Planet
OL,11,     GKathryn Tickell selects music
OL,12,     Gfrom around the globe, and
OL,13,     GScottish singer Julie Fowlis
OL,14,     Gshares a Return Journey in two
OL,15,     Gtracks: one for the road, and one
OL,16,     Gthat reminds her of home.
OL,17,G2230FNew Music Show
OL,18,     GItalian composer Silvia Tarozzi
OL,19,     Gshares her essential listening
OL,20,     Gwith Kate Molleson. Plus more
OL,21,     Gfrom Latvia's Skanu mezs festival.
